--   77950  (Fangs of the Father)
--
-- These are the Dragon Soul legendary daggers. They are present in Item.db2
-- (so name/class/slot are right) but carry no Item-sparse row in this build,
-- so there is no retail stat line to copy. They need hand-authored stats and
-- weapon damage, which is a design call rather than a downport.
